{"node_id": "nd001", "text": "Clarity about future plans", "depth": 1, "parent_id": null, "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.06522408727817482, "confidence_raw": 0.9, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000514-cellD_dec_gated-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Yeah, been on my mind a lot lately, you know? Like, my major and stuff. Feels like I've been jumping around.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 108}, {"session_id": "p000514-cellD_dec_gated-s2", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "It's just frustrating that feeling keeps coming back, even after so much time. I wish I could just focus on what I want to do.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 126}, {"session_id": "p000514-cellD_dec_gated-s2", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "Every time I think about it, I feel like I'm not doing enough. But maybe taking small steps could help.", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 144}, {"session_id": "p000514-cellD_dec_gated-s2", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "It's been hard to make progress on that. Every time I think about it, I feel like I'm not doing enough.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 103}, {"session_id": "p000514-cellD_dec_gated-s2", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "I've changed my major a few times and it feels like a mistake.", "char_start": 96, "char_end": 158}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261009T020419Z", "last_updated_at": "20261009T021837Z", "first_seen_session": "p000514-cellD_dec_gated-s1", "last_session": "p000514-cellD_dec_gated-s2", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": true}
